      "statement": "celld d1 reaches a database by finding a live node through the bucket node leases, signing with the fleet secret, and posting to /runtime/<scope> so the owner executes it; operators cannot read the bucket object directly because that writes behind the fence and the owner's next flush would overwrite it.",
