    {
      "id": "claim_017fcba1bbc34c58b3c342550d27fe3c",
      "statement": "A KV namespace shard is a cell named <namespace-id>/<shard> with SHARDS=1 but the shard carried in the name from the first release, and the FNV-1a shard function is pinned forever because changing it would move keys between cells and make a namespace unreadable across releases.",
      "evidence": [
