      "statement": "Large KV values are written as v2 references v2:e<epoch>:<digest> under kv/blobs-v2/<cell>/e<epoch>/ so an older collector cannot address a newer owner's object and a v0.3.0 node cannot read them, which is part of why the v0.3.0 to v0.4.0 upgrade must stop the whole fleet.",
